  "notes": "{当|あ}てる is a transitive ichidan verb with two core meanings: physically hitting a target, and correctly guessing.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Pair: ⟦{当|あ}たる→当たる：01860_ataru⟧ (intransitive, to hit/be hit)\n\nASPECT (ている):\n{当|あ}てて⟦いる→いる：00495_iru⟧ indicates ongoing action of applying or aiming something.\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{的|まと}→的：19356_mato⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{当|あ}てる: to hit a target\n- ⟦{光|ひかり}→光：01707_hikari⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{当|あ}てる: to shine light on\n- ⟦{日|ひ}→日：02249_hi⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{当|あ}てる: to expose to sunlight\n- ⟦{答|こた}え→答え：00790_kotae⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{当|あ}てる: to guess the answer correctly\n- ⟦くじ→くじ：10315_kuji⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{当|あ}てる: to win a lottery\n- ⟦{人|ひと}→人：00476_hito⟧⟦に→に：00314_ni⟧{当|あ}てる: to call on someone (in class)\n\nUSAGE:\nThe 'guess correctly' meaning often appears in games and quizzes: ⟦{犯人|はんにん}→犯人：03572_hannin⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{当|あ}てる (identify the culprit).",
